Texto al: ['html'] hacer: { <- (
		yo
		reemplazar: ['&'] con: ['&amp;'],
		reemplazar: ['<'] con: ['&lt;'],
		reemplazar: ['>'] con: ['&gt;'],
		reemplazar: ['"'] con: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Lista crear.

['Verbatim Syntax'] caracteres cada: { :número :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (número), Letter: letter).
}.

Salida list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list unir: ['↵']).

Salida escribir: template.

